# Repository Instructions

## Coding Standards

- Prefer clear, maintainable code over clever shortcuts.
- Keep functions focused and small.
- Add or update tests for behavior changes.
- Validate user input and fail safely.
- Avoid destructive commands or data operations unless explicitly requested.

## Workflow Expectations

- Explain tradeoffs when multiple options are reasonable.
- Preserve existing project conventions before introducing new ones.
- Keep dependencies minimal and justified.
- Include short, practical documentation updates with code changes.
